vid Couzens presents the Haig Cup to his father and President of Belgrave Harriers, Bill Couzens.","id":"B191-13","w":"March 1976"},{"f":"crops/B194/B194-p30-couzens-girls-weights.jpg","c":"Bill Couzens organises the girls on a Friday night weights and circuits session.","id":"B194-59","w":"April 1977"},{"f":"crops/B212/B212-p37-relay-organisation.jpg","c":"The other side of the 25 x 1 Mile Relay - The Organisation.\nTop L-R. Bill Laws (Team Manager), Bill Lucas (President), Leo Coy (Major Domo), The Recorders- Bill Couzens, John Morris,Derek Jones,Muswell Hill Runners rep.\nCentre L-R. Leo Coy, Brian Pritchard , Clive Shippen( The Grafters pause to pose) Mr. Starter- Arthur Penny, and I.T.M.A..\nBottom L-R. The Timekeepers- Derek Crookes, Ted Moore, Bill Guttridge, Cyril Gittins ,. Harry Porter(another of the of the Grafters) with I.T.M.A. getting their wires crossed.","id":"B212-40","w":"April 1988"},{"f":"crops/B221/B221-p09-young-athletes-1970s.jpg","c":"Above: The 70s and a photo call after a Young Athletes Sunday morning training session at Wimbledon Park. The adults, left of the group, left to right are: John Martin, Frank Simmons, Jim Heathfield (crouching), Bob Taylor, Reg. Hopkins Jnr., Reg Hopkins Snr. And on the right: John Baker, Philip Gee, Peter Hilliar, Gordon Biscoe, Mickey Pyer, Gordon Doubleday, Alan Mead and Bill Couzens.","id":"B221-23","w":"Winter 1993/94"}],"photo":{"file":"crops/B182/B182-p16-club-championships-collage.jpg","caption":"Top left. Mick Marshall shows all the power of the sprinter. Top right. John Phelan emerges from the 'splash' in the steeplechase. Centre right. The start of a Colts 100 metre race. Bottom left. Field Events Secretary Bill Couzens. Bottom right. Bob Barnes leads some hot company in the walk.","source":"B182-25","when":"September 1973"},"x":1,"share":{"d":"Bill Couzens in The Belgravian, the Belgrave Harriers club gazette, 1955–2005: 284 mentions in 79 issues, 160 race results and 13 photographs. Wrote or reported 18 items.","img":"https://belgravian-images.stephendgardner.workers.dev/belgravian/crops/B190/B190-p06-bill-couzens.jpg","u":"https://stephengardner1.github.io/belgrave-harriers-data/belgravian/read/share/p-bill-couzens.html"},"legend":false}